---
description: "Node/Express API gateway standards"
globs: ["apps/api/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---
# Request validation
- Validate every request body with Zod. Return 400 with field-level errors on failure
- Presigned upload requests must verify the user session. Unauthenticated = 401
- Download requests must verify the job belongs to the current user

# Job management
- Job creation returns jobId immediately. Do not wait for processing to complete
- Timeouts via Convex scheduled functions or timers. Never sleep inside a request
- Webhook endpoints verify signatures, then process asynchronously and return 200 immediately

# Logging
- Structured logging (pino) with requestId, jobId, userId, tool
- Never log user file contents, tokens, or signed URLs
